# Siblings that must be installed WITH their scripts on the CI venue.
#
# The venue installs adjacent siblings with --ignore-scripts, because they are
# normally require()'d as source. xchain-vm ships isolated-vm, a NATIVE addon,
# and this repo EXECUTES it: without the compiled binding the suite dies at
# load with "Cannot find module ./out/isolated_vm" before a test runs. GitHub's
# own job installs the vm's dependencies in an explicit step for this reason.
#
# Kept out of .ci-siblings deliberately: that file is read verbatim as a list
# of repo NAMES by the shared ci-reusable.yml clone loop, by per-repo workflow
# loops and by roster guards, so a modifier written in-line there reaches
# GitHub as a repository that does not exist.
xchain-vm
